# Reddit OAuth (optional) — lets the Reddit source work from cloud hosts like
# Vercel, which Reddit blocks for unauthenticated requests. Without these, the
# app falls back to Reddit's public RSS (works locally, no score/comment counts).
#
# Create a free "script" app at https://www.reddit.com/prefs/apps
#   - type: script
#   - redirect uri: http://localhost:3000 (unused, but required)
# Then copy the client id (under the app name) and secret here.
REDDIT_CLIENT_ID=
REDDIT_CLIENT_SECRET=
